{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">國慶黃金周最後一天，不少旅客早上返程。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">西九龍高鐵站離港大堂人頭湧湧。售票屏幕顯示，大部分短途及長途列車車票均已售罄。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">亦有內地旅客錯峰出行，假期最後一日才訪港，指希望避開人潮，來港「快閃」一、兩天。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.HOLIDAY-1030_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026IdWf5GLHhG1791343982.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.HOLIDAY-1030_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T03:59:44.921080+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":100,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}